KEY BUG FIX:
  alpha_4 at n≥17 requires [3,3,5,5] term (3+3+5+5=16≤17).
  The "triple-of-3-cycles × f[complement]" method only captures quadruples
  with ≥3 three-cycles. [3,3,5,5] needs separate enumeration via:
    sum_{pairs of 3-cycles} c1*c2 × sum_{5-cycles m3 in complement} c3 * f5[comp\m3] / 2

